@startuml
title collapseWhitespace Flowchart

start
:User evaluates collapseWhitespace(s);
if (Exactly one argument?) then (yes)
  if (Argument is non-null String?) then (yes)
    :Trim leading/trailing whitespace;
    :Collapse each whitespace run to one ASCII space;
    :Return normalized string;
  else (no)
    :Return EvalError;
  endif
else (no)
  :Return EvalError;
endif
stop

@enduml
